  "placement_policy": {
    "rotation": "GetPlacementFootprint(false)=definition.FootprintCells; true swaps axes for ordinary buildings. Starting service request does not set RotateVertical; no source automatic rotation search.",
    "center_origin": "StartingBuildingsService.cs57\u201365: center=WorldToCell(authored SpawnWorldXZ); PreferredOrigin=center-readmodelFootprint/2 integer. GridCamera.cs10\u201315 worldcenter=gridOrigin+(origin+footprint*.5)*CellSize, Y=buildPlaneY.",
    "center_binding_gate": "Readmodel-selected actual definition/model footprint, visual local-bounds offset and prefab dependency closure must be verified. Configured rectangles around same grid center are conservative source-review constructions, not exact native object transforms.",
    "foundation": "BuildingPlacementAdapter.cs13\u201315/167\u2013194: every primary sample exists with finite height/slope, slope<=8degrees, max-min<=.5m, maxHeight-gridOriginY<=.75m; every footprint cell required.",
    "foundation_scope": "Runtime IsSkirmishSurfaceValid skips foundation gate absent match/phase!=Playing; survey NativeValid explicitly enforces foundation even for proposed initial facilities. Preserve distinction.",
    "mask": "MapSurfaceComponents.cs193 BuildingPlacement bit=16. Conservative source-data filter; actual ordinary foundation method does not directly test this bit. Mask rectangle alone cannot certify runtime placement.",
    "obstacles": "InvalidCellCache.RoadValidation.cs38\u201352 excludes authored-building overlap, water and ordinary road/sidewalk-surface overlap; PlacementValidationUtility.RoadValidation.cs13\u201342 checks fullgrid bounds, invalidprefix or percell roads/staticblocked except actual runtimeblockers, then runtime/live placement-occupant overlap. Ordinary facilities have no roadgate exemption.",
    "initial_search": "InitialPlacement.cs25\u201391: clamp preferred origin, same fixed rotation; radius=max(80,min(160,max(maxAxis*4,effectiveWidth,effectiveHeight))), ring in radius/dy/dx order; requirePreferredOrigin forbids clamp and sets radius0. Additional authored-road-overlap path is identity-gated mission obstruction, not ordinary S050 facility authority.",
    "spacing": "No universal1m or5m facility clearance found in these ordinary predicates. Historical engineering_gap_metres1 in Full120 is shelf planning only; root-proposed5cell gaps are conservative review construction.",
    "survey_additional": "PilotFacilityRelocation.cs148\u2013160 additionally requires whole effective rect within declaredcompound+typedpad, no spawn/rally/repair/approach reserved-rect overlap, serviceAvailable; prior facility reservations are accumulated. These QA checks do not replace native occupancy/geometry.",
    "service": "PilotRepairInteractionFootprints.cs478\u2013504 requires actual prefab UnitFootprint and UsesVehicleMotion at unique typedService interaction point, NativeEndpointLegal and wholefootprintinsideServicePad; all10 future ground/logistics role cases must be present. Historical nativeServiceAccessQueries proves only Tank/Siege/LogTruck3x3 static endpoints, no facility/liveoccupancy/paidrepair."
  },
